# No-new-mutex allowlist — the declared exception set for scripts/check-no-new-mutex.sh.
# One row per non-test file under VIXEN/libraries + VIXEN/application that carries std mutex/guard
# syntax: <path>\t<owning mutex declarations>\t<inventory family IDs, comma-separated>.
# Family IDs are the lock inventory's (2026-09-08-runtime-lock-inventory-and-classification.md);
# 'VK2-borrowed' = acquires VulkanDevice::SubmitMutex() without owning a lock; 'CENSUS' = the
# LockCensus.h wrapper itself; 'UNCLASSIFIED' = declared here but not yet classified (WARN).
# Counts may only go down; a removal commit must re-sync its row (--fix), an addition must be classified.
VIXEN/libraries/CashSystem/include/TypeRegistry.h	1	C6
VIXEN/libraries/Core/include/LockCensus.h	4	CENSUS
VIXEN/libraries/ResourceManagement/include/Memory/BudgetBridge.h	1	RM13
VIXEN/libraries/ResourceManagement/include/Memory/HostBudgetManager.h	1	RM3
VIXEN/libraries/ResourceManagement/src/Memory/BatchedUploader.cpp	0	BOOKKEEPING-GATE
VIXEN/libraries/ResourceManagement/src/Memory/BudgetBridge.cpp	0	RM13
VIXEN/libraries/ResourceManagement/src/Memory/HostBudgetManager.cpp	0	RM3
VIXEN/libraries/ResourceManagement/src/Memory/StagingBufferPool.cpp	0	BOOKKEEPING-GATE
